  input is unreasonable/1 : (goal)  % assumed.l4:86:1-87:40
    params: Behaviour
    (no clauses)
  input is of a persistent nature/1 : (goal)  % assumed.l4:89:1-90:50
    params: Behaviour
    (no clauses)
  computed exported may issue a notice/1 : (goal)  % assumed.l4:98:1-103:42
    params: Person
    desc: whether the person may issue a community protection notice
    ref: s 43(1)
    may issue a notice(Person_0) :- is authorised(Person_0), not has surrendered authority(Person_0), conduct(Person_0, Conduct_1), is unreasonable(Conduct_1).  % assumed.l4:101:8-103:42
  computed exported is a persistent nuisance/1 : (goal)  % assumed.l4:107:1-110:47
